**Decision variables:**
- $x_i \in \mathbb{Z}$, $\text{MaxShort}_i \leq x_i \leq \text{MaxLong}_i$
- $y_i \geq |x_i|$

**Objective:**
- Minimize $\sum_{i=1}^{120} \text{Cost}_i \cdot y_i$

